          "sourceDecision": "approve_qualified_acquisition_support",
          "concreteJurisdictionReason": "The original common titration block requires principle and evaluation of acid/base titration and calculations of concentrations, amounts and masses. These require the mol/entity meaning and stoichiometric amount relationships. The unrelated selected redox-titration anchor is replaced.",
